msgid "Enter v3 Site Key"
msgstr "Masukkan kunci situs V3"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:702
msgid "v3 Secret Key"
msgstr "V3 Kunci Rahasia"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:705
msgid "Enter v3 Secret Key"
msgstr "Masukkan V3 Secret Key"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:741
msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "Peringatan"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:743
msgid "Get alerts about suspected fraudulent activities <hr/>"
msgstr "Dapatkan peringatan tentang dugaan kegiatan penipuan <hr/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:747
msgid "Activate Email Alerts for Admin"
msgstr "Aktifkan peringatan email untuk admin"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:752
msgid "Enable to receive fraud alerts on admin email address when risk-score exceeds value set in Email Notification Score."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk menerima peringatan penipuan di alamat email admin ketika skor risiko melebihi nilai yang ditetapkan dalam skor pemberitahuan email."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:756
msgid "Additional Address(es) to Notify"
msgstr "Alamat tambahan untuk memberi tahu"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:759
msgid "Add additional email address(es) you want to be notified upon exceeding Risk-score. Press “Comma”, TAB or ENTER button for the next entry."
msgstr "Tambahkan alamat email tambahan Anda ingin diberitahu setelah melebihi skor risiko. Tekan \"Comma\", Tab atau Enter Tombol untuk entri berikutnya."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:766
msgid "Email Notification Score"
msgstr "Skor pemberitahuan email"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:770
msgid "Risk scores that meet or exceed this value will trigger email alerts to your specified email addresses."
msgstr "Skor risiko yang memenuhi atau melampaui nilai ini akan memicu peringatan email ke alamat email yang Anda tentukan."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:795
msgid "Blacklist"
msgstr "Daftar hitam"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:797
msgid "WooCommerce Anti-Fraud allows you to create a list of email addresses as well as a list of IP addresses that will always be marked as potential fraud transactions."
msgstr "WooCommerce Anti-Fraud memungkinkan Anda untuk membuat daftar alamat email serta daftar alamat IP yang akan selalu ditandai sebagai transaksi penipuan potensial."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:802
msgid "Email Blacklisting"
msgstr "Email daftar hitam"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:812
msgid "Email Blacklist"
msgstr "Daftar Hitam Email"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:817
msgid "Enable the email blacklist function to block emails captured by WooCommerce Anti-fraud rules."
msgstr "Aktifkan fungsi Blacklist Email untuk memblokir email yang ditangkap oleh aturan anti-penipuan WooCommerce."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:822
msgid "Automatic Blacklisting"
msgstr "Daftar Hitam Otomatis"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:827
msgid "Add email addresses of orders reported with a high risk of fraud to blacklist automatically."
msgstr "Tambahkan alamat email pesanan yang dilaporkan berisiko tinggi penipuan ke daftar hitam secara otomatis."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:832
msgid "Blocked Email Addresses"
msgstr "Alamat Email yang Diblokir"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:835
msgid "The email addresses listed in the text area will be considered unsafe. You can also add or remove emails manually here. Type “,” or press TAB/ENTER button for the next entry. Please add emails in bulk separating them by either comma or space."
msgstr "Alamat email yang tercantum di area teks akan dianggap tidak aman. Anda juga dapat menambah atau menghapus email secara manual di sini. Ketik “,” atau tekan tombol TAB/ENTER untuk entri berikutnya. Harap tambahkan email secara massal, pisahkan dengan koma atau spasi."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:843
msgid "IP Blacklisting"
msgstr "Daftar Hitam IP"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:853
msgid "IP Blacklist"
msgstr "Daftar Hitam IP"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:857
msgid "Enable the IP blacklist function"
msgstr "Aktifkan fungsi daftar hitam IP"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:858
msgid "Enable the IP blacklist function to block IP addresses with high risk of frauds."
msgstr "Aktifkan fungsi daftar hitam IP untuk memblokir alamat IP dengan risiko penipuan yang tinggi."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:863
msgid "Blocked IP Addresses"
msgstr "Alamat IP yang Diblokir"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:866
msgid "The IP addresses listed in the text area will be considered unsafe.  You can also add or remove IP addresses manually here. Type “,” or press TAB/ENTER button for the next entry. Please add IPs in bulk separating them by either comma or space."
msgstr "Alamat IP yang tercantum di area teks akan dianggap tidak aman. Anda juga dapat menambah atau menghapus alamat IP secara manual di sini. Ketik “,” atau tekan tombol TAB/ENTER untuk entri berikutnya. Harap tambahkan IP secara massal dan pisahkan dengan koma atau spasi."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:894
msgid "These settings are specific to Paypal Payment Gateway. This means, when the customer use their Paypal account for making payment for their orders, then these rules come into action.<hr/>"
msgstr "Pengaturan ini khusus untuk Gateway Pembayaran Paypal. Artinya, ketika pelanggan menggunakan akun Paypalnya untuk melakukan pembayaran atas pesanannya, maka aturan ini akan berlaku.<hr/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:902
msgid "Select to enable Paypal verification"
msgstr "Pilih untuk mengaktifkan verifikasi Paypal"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:907
msgid "Block Downloads"
msgstr "Blokir Unduhan"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:911
msgid "Prevent digital downloads if verification failed or still processing"
msgstr "Cegah pengunduhan digital jika verifikasi gagal atau masih diproses"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:916
msgid "Verification Retry"
msgstr "Verifikasi Coba Lagi"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:918
msgid "Number of days that have to pass before sending another email if the order is still waiting for verification"
msgstr "Jumlah hari yang harus dilewati sebelum mengirim email lagi jika pesanan masih menunggu verifikasi"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:929
msgid "Auto Cancellation Days"
msgstr "Hari Pembatalan Otomatis"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:931
msgid "Orders that are not verified within the given number of days will be automatically cancelled"
msgstr "Pesanan yang tidak terverifikasi dalam jumlah hari yang ditentukan akan dibatalkan secara otomatis"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:942
msgid "Paypal verified addresses"
msgstr "Alamat terverifikasi Paypal"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:944
msgid "Verified email addresses"
msgstr "Alamat email terverifikasi"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:954
msgid "Email Template"
msgstr "Templat Email"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:956
msgid "Configure the email template below. The following tags can be embedded in the template fields:<br/><br/><b>{site_title}</b> - replaced with the Wordpress Site Title<br/><b>{site_email}</b> - replaced with the Wordpress site admin email address"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan template email di bawah ini. Tag berikut bisa disematkan di bidang templat:<br/><br/><b>{site_title}</b> - diganti dengan Judul Situs Wordpress<br/><b>{site_email}</b> - diganti dengan alamat email admin situs wordpress"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:962
msgid "Email Type"
msgstr "Jenis Email"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:968
msgid "Emails can be sent either as plain text or HTML"
msgstr "Email dapat dikirim baik sebagai teks biasa atau HTML"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:976
msgid "The subject of the email that will be sent to the purchaser"
msgstr "Subjek email yang akan dikirimkan ke pembeli"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:979
msgid "[{site_title}] Confirm your PayPal email address"
msgstr "[{site_title}] Konfirmasikan alamat email PayPal Anda"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:983
msgid "Email body"
msgstr "Badan email"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:988
msgid "Hi!We have received your order on {site_title}, but to complete we have to verify your PayPal email address.If you havent made or authorized any purchase, please, contact PayPal support service immediately,and email us to {site_email} for having your money back."
msgstr "Hai! Kami telah menerima pesanan Anda di {site_title}, namun untuk menyelesaikannya kami harus memverifikasi alamat email PayPal Anda. Jika Anda belum melakukan atau mengizinkan pembelian apa pun, harap segera hubungi layanan dukungan PayPal, dan kirimkan email kepada kami ke {site_email} untuk mendapatkan uangmu kembali."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1005
msgid "General behaviours of the Anti Fraud plugin are configured on this page.<hr/>"
msgstr "Perilaku umum plugin Anti Penipuan dikonfigurasikan di halaman ini.<hr/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1011
msgid "Set Risk Thresholds"
msgstr "Tetapkan Ambang Batas Risiko"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1013
msgid "There are three risk thresholds.  Low, Medium and High.   In this section you can define where the boundary point between those thresholds.   The maximum risk score is 100, the minimum is 0.<br/>"
msgstr "Ada tiga ambang batas risiko. Rendah, Sedang dan Tinggi. Pada bagian ini Anda dapat menentukan di mana titik batas antara ambang batas tersebut. Skor risiko maksimum adalah 100, minimum adalah 0.<br/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1014
msgid "There are three risk thresholds: Low, Medium and High. In this section, you can define where the boundary point between those thresholds. The maximum risk score is 100, the minimum is 0. Orders are considered Low, Medium, and High Risk Orders based on these values."
msgstr "Ada tiga ambang batas risiko: Rendah, Sedang dan Tinggi. Di bagian ini, Anda dapat menentukan di mana titik batas antara ambang batas tersebut. Skor risiko maksimum adalah 100, minimum adalah 0. Pesanan dianggap Pesanan Berisiko Rendah, Sedang, dan Tinggi berdasarkan nilai-nilai ini."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1020
msgid "Medium Risk threshold"
msgstr "Ambang Batas Risiko Sedang"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1034
msgid "High Risk threshold"
msgstr "Ambang Batas Risiko Tinggi"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1048
msgid "Enable debug logging"
msgstr "Aktifkan pencatatan debug"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1060
msgid "Pre-Purchase Assessment"
msgstr "Penilaian Pra-Pembelian"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1069
msgid "Pre-Payment Checking"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan Pra-Pembayaran"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1079
msgid "Notification message for Blocked users"
msgstr "Pesan pemberitahuan untuk pengguna yang diblokir"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1083
#: woocommerce-anti-fraud.php:1362
msgid "Website Administrator does not allow you to place this order. Please contact our support team. Sorry for any inconvenience."
msgstr "Administrator Situs Web tidak mengizinkan Anda melakukan pemesanan ini. Silakan hubungi tim dukungan kami. Maaf untuk ketidaknyamanan."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1085
msgid "Adds a custom alert message for blocked users on Pre-Payment Check. This message will be shown to the user on the checkout page while they attempt to pay."
msgstr "Menambahkan pesan peringatan khusus untuk pengguna yang diblokir pada Cek Pra-Pembayaran. Pesan ini akan ditampilkan kepada pengguna di halaman checkout saat mereka mencoba membayar."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1095
msgid "Change Order Status based on Risk Score"
msgstr "Ubah Status Pesanan berdasarkan Skor Risiko"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1104
msgid "Update Order Status based on Fraud Score"
msgstr "Perbarui Status Pesanan berdasarkan Skor Penipuan"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1109
msgid "Enable to cancel and/or put orders on hold based on Risk Score."
msgstr "Memungkinkan untuk membatalkan dan/atau menahan pesanan berdasarkan Skor Risiko."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1113
msgid "Weighting to Cancel Order"
msgstr "Pembobotan untuk Membatalkan Pesanan"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1118
msgid "Orders with a score equal to or greater than this value will be automatically cancelled. <br/> To disable it, slide the slider to the extreme left or Select 0."
msgstr "Pesanan dengan skor sama atau lebih besar dari nilai ini akan dibatalkan secara otomatis. <br/> Untuk menonaktifkannya, geser penggeser ke paling kiri atau Pilih 0."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1124
msgid "Weighting to put Order On-hold"
msgstr "Pembobotan untuk menunda Pesanan"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1128
msgid "Orders with a score equal to or greater than this number will be automatically set on hold. <br/> To disable it, slide the slider to the extreme left or Select 0."
msgstr "Pesanan dengan skor sama atau lebih besar dari angka ini akan otomatis ditangguhkan. <br/> Untuk menonaktifkannya, geser penggeser ke paling kiri atau Pilih 0."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1139
msgid "Whitelist Payment Methods"
msgstr "Metode Pembayaran Daftar Putih"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1148
msgid "Enable Whitelisting of Payment Methods"
msgstr "Aktifkan Daftar Putih Metode Pembayaran"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1157
msgid "Select Payment Methods to be Whitelisted"
msgstr "Pilih Metode Pembayaran untuk Masuk Daftar Putih"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1171
msgid "User Roles Whitelisting"
msgstr "Daftar Putih Peran Pengguna"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1180
msgid "Enable Whitelisting of User Roles"
msgstr "Aktifkan Daftar Putih Peran Pengguna"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1189
msgid "Select User Roles to be Whitelisted"
msgstr "Pilih Peran Pengguna untuk Masuk Daftar Putih"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1195
msgid "Select roles"
msgstr "Pilih peran"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1204
msgid "Whitelisted Emails"
msgstr "Email yang Masuk Daftar Putih"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1213
msgid "Email Whitelist"
msgstr "Daftar Putih Email"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1230
msgid "Whitelisted IPs"
msgstr "IP yang masuk daftar putih"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1239
msgid "IPs Whitelist"
msgstr "Daftar Putih IP"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1257
msgid "Auto Fraud Check For Existing Orders"
msgstr "Penipuan Otomatis Periksa Pesanan yang Ada"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1266
msgid "Enable Auto Fraud Check"
msgstr "Aktifkan Pemeriksaan Penipuan Otomatis"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1276
msgid "No Of Days For Historical Orders Checks"
msgstr "Jumlah Hari Untuk Pemeriksaan Pesanan Historis"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1298
msgid "Enable Debug Logging"
msgstr "Aktifkan Pencatatan Debug"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1307
msgid "Enable Debug Log"
msgstr "Aktifkan Log Debug"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1350
#: anti-fraud-core/tamplate-admin-settings-page.php:401
msgid "General Rules"
msgstr "Aturan umum"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1352
msgid "Each rule that is matched will add the configured &quot;Rule Weight&quot; value to the overall fraud score.  In this section you can configure general fraud detection rules.<hr/>"
msgstr "Setiap aturan yang cocok akan menambahkan &quot;Bobot Aturan &quot; nilai terhadap skor penipuan secara keseluruhan. Di bagian ini Anda dapat mengonfigurasi aturan deteksi penipuan umum.<hr/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1357
msgid "First Time Purchase Rules"
msgstr "Aturan Pembelian Pertama Kali"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1359
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1360
msgid "Rule set for Buyers who are purchasing from your website for the first time."
msgstr "Aturan ditetapkan untuk Pembeli yang membeli dari situs web Anda untuk pertama kalinya."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1367
msgid "First Purchase on Website"
msgstr "Pembelian Pertama di Situs Web"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1372
msgid "Enable it to identify customers purchasing from your website for the first time."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk mengidentifikasi pelanggan yang membeli dari situs web Anda untuk pertama kalinya."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1376
msgid "First Purchase Rule Weight"
msgstr "Berat Aturan Pembelian Pertama"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1389
msgid "Re-Check First Orders in Processing State?"
msgstr "Periksa Ulang Pesanan Pertama dalam Status Pemrosesan?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1394
msgid "Enable it to perform first-order re-check on orders in processing state."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk melakukan pemeriksaan ulang pesanan pertama pada pesanan dalam status pemrosesan."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1417
msgid "IP, Billing and Shipping Address-based Rules"
msgstr "Aturan berbasis IP, Penagihan, dan Alamat Pengiriman"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1420
msgid "Rules set for identifying fraudulent orders triggering risks based on IP, billing and shipping addresses."
msgstr "Aturan yang ditetapkan untuk mengidentifikasi pesanan palsu yang memicu risiko berdasarkan IP, alamat penagihan, dan pengiriman."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1428
msgid "Does Geo Location Match?"
msgstr "Apakah Lokasi Geo Cocok?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1433
msgid "Enable it to identify that customer's shipping/billing state matches the state provided by Geo Location."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk mengidentifikasi negara bagian pengiriman/penagihan pelanggan sesuai dengan negara bagian yang disediakan oleh Lokasi Geo."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1451
msgid "API Key for bigdatacloud.com"
msgstr "Kunci API untuk bigdatacloud.com"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1453
msgid "Don't have bigdatacloud.com account? <a href=\"https://www.bigdatacloud.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Signup here</a><br/>Get 50K requests per month for free. Upgrade for more."
msgstr "Belum punya akun bigdatacloud.com? <a href=\"https://www.bigdatacloud.com/\"  target=\"_blank\">Daftar di sini</a><br/>Dapatkan 50 ribu permintaan per bulan secara gratis. Tingkatkan versi untuk lebih banyak lagi."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1454
msgid "You can use bigdatacloud.com to get accurate address via customer Lat and Long and its required to use geo location rule."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan bigdatacloud.com untuk mendapatkan alamat yang akurat melalui lintang dan bujur pelanggan dan diharuskan menggunakan aturan lokasi geografis."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1460
msgid "Are Billing and Shipping Addresses Same?"
msgstr "Apakah Alamat Penagihan dan Pengiriman Sama?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1465
msgid "Enable to identify difference between billing and shipping addresses."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk mengidentifikasi perbedaan antara alamat penagihan dan pengiriman."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1482
msgid "Enable Phone Number and Billing Country Check"
msgstr "Aktifkan Pemeriksaan Nomor Telepon dan Negara Penagihan"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1487
msgid "If you enable this rule, then it is highly recommended that you use a separate Phone Number Validation plugin to make sure your customers specify a correct international phone number format on the checkout page. Else, this rule will treat an invalid phone number as a risk."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengaktifkan aturan ini, sangat disarankan agar Anda menggunakan plugin Validasi Nomor Telepon terpisah untuk memastikan pelanggan Anda menentukan format nomor telepon internasional yang benar di halaman checkout. Jika tidak, aturan ini akan menganggap nomor telepon yang tidak valid sebagai risiko."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1496
msgid "Weight of the single rule in the total calculation of risk."
msgstr "Bobot aturan tunggal dalam total perhitungan risiko."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1506
msgid "Is Customer behind Proxy or VPN?"
msgstr "Apakah Pelanggan mendukung Proxy atau VPN?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1511
msgid "Check if the customer is behind either a proxy or a VPN"
msgstr "Periksa apakah pelanggan menggunakan proxy atau VPN"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1534
msgid "Multiple Orders Attempts using Different Addresses from Same IP"
msgstr "Upaya Pesanan Berganda menggunakan Alamat Berbeda dari IP yang Sama"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1537
msgid "Rule to check buyer is ordering products using different addresses from the same IP over a certain period from your store."
msgstr "Aturan yang harus diperiksa pembeli adalah memesan produk menggunakan alamat berbeda dari IP yang sama selama periode tertentu dari toko Anda."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1543
msgid ""
"Purchased from same IP but Different Customer Addresses?\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"
msgstr ""
"Dibeli dari IP yang sama tetapi Alamat Pelanggan Berbeda?\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1552
msgid "Enable this rule to monitor if multiple orders with different billing or shipping addresses have originated from the same IP address. Make sure to set time span of checking."
msgstr "Aktifkan aturan ini untuk memantau apakah beberapa pesanan dengan alamat penagihan atau pengiriman berbeda berasal dari alamat IP yang sama. Pastikan untuk mengatur rentang waktu pemeriksaan."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1569
msgid "Past Number of Days to Check "
msgstr "Jumlah Hari Terakhir untuk Diperiksa"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1572
msgid "The number of days in the past to check IP addresses and different physical addresses."
msgstr "Jumlah hari yang lalu untuk memeriksa alamat IP dan alamat fisik yang berbeda."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1588
msgid "Origin Countries"
msgstr "Negara Asal"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1591
msgid "International orders tend to have a higher fraud risk than orders that originate in your home country. Merchants often find that certain origin countries have a higher potential for fraud. These Rule sets help manage such risks."
msgstr "Pesanan internasional cenderung memiliki risiko penipuan lebih tinggi dibandingkan pesanan yang berasal dari negara asal Anda. Pedagang sering kali mendapati bahwa negara asal tertentu memiliki potensi penipuan yang lebih tinggi. Rangkaian Peraturan ini membantu mengelola risiko tersebut."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1597
msgid "Is it International Order?"
msgstr "Apakah itu Tatanan Internasional?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1602
msgid "Enable to check if the order originates from outside of your store's home country."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk memeriksa apakah pesanan berasal dari luar negara asal toko Anda."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1619
msgid "Is Order from High-Risk Country?"
msgstr "Apakah Pesanan dari Negara Berisiko Tinggi?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1624
msgid "Enable it to check if orders originate from unsafe countries. Select unsafe countries from the list below."
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk memeriksa apakah pesanan berasal dari negara yang tidak aman. Pilih negara-negara yang tidak aman dari daftar di bawah."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1641
msgid "Mark Unsafe Countries"
msgstr "Tandai Negara yang Tidak Aman"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1657
msgid "High-Risk Email Domains"
msgstr "Domain Email Berisiko Tinggi"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1660
msgid "Merchants often find that certain email domains have a higher potential for fraud. These Rule sets will help you manage High-Risk Email Domains.<br/>Identify High-Risk Domains by manually adding such email domains to High-Risk Domain section and/or using QuickEmailVerification.com API key to make this operation automatic."
msgstr "Penjual sering kali mendapati bahwa domain email tertentu memiliki potensi penipuan yang lebih tinggi. Kumpulan Aturan ini akan membantu Anda mengelola Domain Email Berisiko Tinggi. <br/>Identifikasi Domain Berisiko Tinggi dengan menambahkan domain email tersebut secara manual ke bagian Domain Berisiko Tinggi dan/atau menggunakan kunci API QuickEmailVerification.com untuk menjadikan operasi ini otomatis."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1666
msgid "Is Suspicious / High-Risk Email Domain?"
msgstr "Apakah Domain Email Mencurigakan/Risiko Tinggi?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1671
msgid "Enable it to check if customer's email address originates from any high-risk domain listed below and/or add API for “quickemailverification. com” for automatic checking"
msgstr "Aktifkan untuk memeriksa apakah alamat email pelanggan berasal dari domain berisiko tinggi yang tercantum di bawah dan/atau menambahkan API untuk “quickemailverification. com” untuk pemeriksaan otomatis"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1688
msgid "High-Risk Domains"
msgstr "Domain Berisiko Tinggi"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1698
msgid "API Key for quickemailverification.com"
msgstr "Kunci API untuk quickemailverification.com"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1700
msgid "Don't have quickemailverification account? <a href=\"\">Signup here</a><br/>Verify 50 emails for free. Upgrade if you want more"
msgstr "Tidak punya akun verifikasi email cepat? <a href=\"\">Daftar di sini</a> <br/>Verifikasi 50 email secara gratis. Tingkatkan versi jika Anda menginginkan lebih"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1701
msgid "You can use quickemailverification.com to get more accurate results for false email domain-related checks. "
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan quickemailverification.com untuk mendapatkan hasil yang lebih akurat untuk pemeriksaan terkait domain email palsu."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1711
msgid "Order Amounts and Attempts"
msgstr "Jumlah Pesanan dan Upaya"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1714
msgid "The rules in this section are triggered based on defined order amounts and by counting attempted orders. You can also limit orders within a certain time frame. Orders with unusually high values, or customers who make an excessive number of transactions in a short period are more likely to be fraudulent."
msgstr "Aturan di bagian ini dipicu berdasarkan jumlah pesanan yang ditentukan dan dengan menghitung upaya pesanan. Anda juga dapat membatasi pesanan dalam jangka waktu tertentu. Pesanan dengan nilai yang sangat tinggi, atau pelanggan yang melakukan transaksi dalam jumlah berlebihan dalam waktu singkat lebih cenderung melakukan penipuan."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1720
msgid "Order Amount is Above Average?"
msgstr "Jumlah Pesanan Di Atas Rata-Rata?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1725
msgid "Check if order significantly exceeds the average order amount for your site. Set multiplier value to trigger this rule when order place is value times greater than an average order."
msgstr "Periksa apakah pesanan secara signifikan melebihi jumlah pesanan rata-rata untuk situs Anda. Tetapkan nilai pengganda untuk memicu aturan ini ketika nilai tempat pesanan kali lebih besar dari pesanan rata-rata."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1742
msgid "Average Multiplier"
msgstr "Pengganda Rata-rata"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1745
msgid "Enter the multiplier value to check amount over average transaction value that will trigger the rule (expressed as a multiplier). For example, if you want to limit orders that are 2 times greater than the average value of orders, set the multiplier value to 2."
msgstr "Masukkan nilai pengganda untuk memeriksa jumlah di atas rata-rata nilai transaksi yang akan memicu aturan (dinyatakan sebagai pengganda). Misalnya, jika Anda ingin membatasi pesanan yang 2 kali lebih besar dari nilai rata-rata pesanan, tetapkan nilai pengali menjadi 2."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1755
msgid "Order Exceeds Maximum Amount Limit?"
msgstr "Pesanan Melebihi Batas Jumlah Maksimum?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1760
msgid "Enable this rule to confirm that the total amount of the order does not exceed maximum configured amount below."
msgstr "Aktifkan aturan ini untuk mengonfirmasi bahwa jumlah total pesanan tidak melebihi jumlah maksimum yang dikonfigurasi di bawah."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1777
msgid "Amount Limit ($)"
msgstr "Batas Jumlah ($)"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1780
msgid "Enter the maximum amount of purchase accepted in your store."
msgstr "Masukkan jumlah maksimum pembelian yang diterima di toko Anda."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1787
msgid "Too many order attempts?"
msgstr "Terlalu banyak upaya pemesanan?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1792
msgid "Enabling this rule allows you to limit number of orders per user within the time span configured below."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan aturan ini memungkinkan Anda membatasi jumlah pesanan per pengguna dalam rentang waktu yang dikonfigurasi di bawah."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1809
msgid "Time Span to Check (hours)"
msgstr "Rentang Waktu Pengecekan (jam)"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1812
msgid "Enter number of hours you want to check "
msgstr "Masukkan jumlah jam yang ingin Anda periksa "

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1818
msgid "Maximum Allowed Number of Orders in Time Span?"
msgstr "Jumlah Pesanan Maksimum yang Diizinkan dalam Rentang Waktu?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1821
msgid "Enter a total number of orders that a buyer can make in the specified time span."
msgstr "Masukkan jumlah total pesanan yang dapat dilakukan pembeli dalam rentang waktu yang ditentukan."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1832
msgid "Limit Number of Orders between Time"
msgstr "Batasi Jumlah Pesanan antar Waktu"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1837
msgid "Enabling this rule limits the number of orders to be placed within a certain period of the day."
msgstr "Mengaktifkan aturan ini membatasi jumlah pesanan yang akan dilakukan dalam jangka waktu tertentu dalam sehari."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1841
msgid "Start Time "
msgstr "Waktu mulai "

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1844
msgid "Needs to be as per server time. Check in woo general settings. Accordingly specify start time."
msgstr "Harus sesuai waktu server. Periksa di pengaturan umum woo. Tentukan waktu mulainya."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1850
msgid "End Time "
msgstr "Akhir waktu"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1853
msgid "Needs to be as per server time. Check in woo general settings. Accordingly specify end time."
msgstr "Harus sesuai waktu server. Periksa di pengaturan umum woo. Tentukan waktu berakhirnya."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1859
msgid "Maximum Allowed Number of Orders Between Time"
msgstr "Jumlah Pesanan Maksimum yang Diizinkan Antar Waktu"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1862
msgid "Enter maximum number of orders that can be placed during specified time span."
msgstr "Masukkan jumlah maksimum pesanan yang dapat dilakukan selama rentang waktu tertentu."

